d":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTIxMzk5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70921399?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/avedar","html_url":"https://github.com/avedar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avedar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avedar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avedar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avedar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avedar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avedar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avedar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avedar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avedar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-28T20:27:00Z","updated_at":"2025-03-28T20:27:00Z","body":"> I agree that showing scrollbar as an overlay on hover is the cleanest solution, blender is doing the same btw:\r\n> blenderscrollbar.mp4\r\n\r\nTo be clear, Blender is doing a mix of several things in this video which all feel pretty reasonable:\r\n\r\n1. Very narrow reserved/scrollbar space\r\n2. Scrollbar only visible when scrollable\r\n3. Only scrollbar grows on hover\r\n\r\nThe key being it's probably using the narrowest amount of reserved space possible","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2762387042/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2763344352","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104605#issuecomment-2763344352","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104605","id":2763344352,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ktUng","user":{"logi